
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_SIZE: number = 7`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_SIZE = 7;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_SIZE has the value 7</p>
  <p>Returns or sets the prim's <b>size</b>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>PrimParam</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>llSetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">&#32;PRIM_SIZE,&#32;[vector</a> size ] </b></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• vector</td>
        <td>size</td>
        <td>–</td>
        <td>ranges from 0.01 to 64.0 for x, y and z</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>When used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetPrimitiveParams</a> & <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetLinkPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParams</a></p>
  <h2>llGetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llGetPrimitiveParams</a>([ PRIM_SIZE ]); </b></p>
  <p>Returns the list <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank"> [vector</a> size ]</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• vector</td>
        <td>size</td>
        <td>–</td>
        <td>ranges from 0.01 to 64.0 for x, y and z</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Does not work on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/STATUS_PHYSICS" target="_blank">physical</a> prims.</li>
  </ul>
